  abilityName: Gone Home Running
  abilityDesc: Massive Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec of Dark types for 3 turns, considerably boosts OD
    gauge, enormously boosts own Spark damage for 3 turns & Spark vulnerability infliction
    for 3 turns
